%% render: auto
%% title: Autonomous agent decision loop
%% desc: From requirements to recorded decisions. Rendering and critique repeat until the acceptance criteria pass.
flowchart TD
    A["Analyze requirements • brief, project instructions"]:::slate
    B["Retrieve authorized project context • only what the task needs"]:::purple
    C{"Existing capabilities sufficient?"}:::amber
    D["Select minimum sufficient tools • one authority per asset"]:::purple
    E["Verify dependencies and permissions • pin, review, isolate"]:::slate
    F["Implement • explicit handoff contracts"]:::blue
    G["Render and inspect • the real artifact"]:::blue
    H["Critique • against the brief and gates"]:::green
    I{"Acceptance criteria passed?"}:::amber
    J["Refine and retest • fix the findings"]:::amber
    K["Deliver artifacts • sources, renders, commands, versions"]:::green
    L["Record approved decisions • decision log, DESIGN.md"]:::purple
    A --> B
    B --> C
    C -->|No| D
    D --> E
    E --> F
    C -->|Yes| F
    F --> G
    G --> H
    H --> I
    I -->|No| J
    J -.->|rerender| G
    I -->|Yes| K
    K --> L
    classDef slate fill:#edf2f7,stroke:#596b84,color:#142137
    classDef purple fill:#f0e8fc,stroke:#733ed0,color:#142137
    classDef blue fill:#e7effe,stroke:#2363cf,color:#142137
    classDef amber fill:#fff0da,stroke:#a05212,color:#142137
    classDef teal fill:#dff6f0,stroke:#087d73,color:#142137
    classDef rose fill:#fee8ed,stroke:#bf315c,color:#142137
    classDef green fill:#e1f4e7,stroke:#198047,color:#142137
